# Reverse Engineering

### Static Analysis

Reading and understanding source code without executing the program.

### Dynamic Analysis

Running the program to observe its behavior.

### Hash Comparison

Instead of guessing passwords manually, compute the hash of each candidate and compare it with the stored hash.

### Dictionary Attack

Testing passwords from a wordlist automatically until a match is found.

